WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:09,170
Put the kids in the car and come back. I'll wait for you here. Don't scream.

2
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
She's getting your kids to a safe place.

3
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:22,910
Are you afraid?

4
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,910
I never put my trust in anyone

5
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:27,980
We can provide you with food and medicine.

6
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,980
Only trust cannot be given

7
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:39,180
She's fine. She's safe.

8
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,180
Wait until I take your children to a safe place

9
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:42,180
Take you there again
